sequenceDiagram
  actor O as Owner
  participant T as Tab bar and top bar
  participant H as Home
  participant B as Orders
  participant I as Inventory
  participant A as Sales
  participant M as More
  participant N as Notifications
  O->>T: 1: Log in as Owner
  T->>H: 2: Open Home (first tab)
  O->>T: 3: Tap Orders
  T->>B: 4: Open Order Board
  O->>T: 5: Tap Inventory
  T->>I: 6: Open Stock Overview
  O->>T: 7: Tap Sales
  T->>A: 8: Open Daily Sales Report
  O->>T: 9: Tap More
  T->>M: 10: Open More menu
  O->>T: 11: Tap the bell
  T->>N: 12: Open Notifications (alerts and preferences)
  O->>T: 13: Tap Admin, choose Staff view or Delivery view
  T-->>O: 14: Staff tabs or Rider tabs, same account
